Verdi2024 uses a non-Gaussian Bayesian regression model identified as warped Bayesian linear regression with covariates age, sex, and site; it applies calibrated transfer learning. The response variables include cortical thickness of 148 regions and gray matter tissue volumes of 20 subcortical areas, covering both cortical thickness and subcortical volume categories.
